Medicare Plans, and to allow any excess contribution to the HRA, if any, to be used to reimburse the retiree and spouse for any qualifying medical expenses; BE IT FURTHER RESOLVED, that, for the 12-month period beginning August 1, 2017, the Town of Pine Mountain shall contribute the amount of Six Thousand Dollars ($6,000.00) to the

HRA for each qualifying retiree, and shall determine the amount to be contributed to the HRA each year hereafter;

BE IT FURTHER RESOLVED, that all actions heretofore taken to the contrary of the foregoing are hereby repealed;

BE IT FURTHER RESOLVED, that the Mayor of Pine Mountain is authorized to execute, and the Town Clerk is authorized to attest, any and all agreements and contracts necessary to adopt and fund the HRA and to offer the Medicare Plans through OneExchange, as described above and upon such further terms and conditions as deemed reasonable or necessary by the Mayor.

This 25 day of April, 2017.
